				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFay.</u>
					112.20
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			metaph., <i>oppress</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				10.8
			</span></i>,al. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλάω</span>.)</div>
